### Prihlásenie čašníka
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "casnik", "password": "casnik2026"}

> {% client.global.set("waiterToken", response.body.token); %}

### Hosť: identifikácia stola 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/session
Content-Type: application/json

{"tableId": 2, "token": "dev-token-stol-2"}

> {% client.global.set("guestToken", response.body.token); %}

### Hosť: účet (uloží id účtu)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

> {% client.global.set("accountId", response.body.id); %}

### Hosť: platba pred potvrdením účtu → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method": "CARD"}

### Čašník: potvrdenie účtu
POST http://localhost:8080/api/waiter/accounts/{{accountId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### Hosť: objednávka (bryndzové halušky)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"menuItemId": 4, "quantity": 1}]}

### Hosť: platba kartou – gatewayUrl otvor v prehliadači a zaplať kartou 4200 0000 0000 0001 (zamietnutie)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method": "CARD"}

### Hosť: po zamietnutí je účet stále AWAITING_PAYMENT a objednávať sa nedá → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"menuItemId": 4, "quantity": 1}]}

### Hosť: nový pokus kartou – novú gatewayUrl otvor, ale NEPLAŤ, len stránku zavri
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method": "CARD"}

### Čašník: uzavretie pri nedokončenej platbe kartou → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/waiter/accounts/{{accountId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### Hosť: ďalší pokus kartou – gatewayUrl otvor a zaplať kartou 4200 0000 0000 0000
POST http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method": "CARD"}

### Hosť: o 5–10 s po zaplatení → 403 Účet je uzavretý (server ho uzavrel sám)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/guest/account
Authorization: Bearer {{guestToken}}

### Čašník: prehľad stolov – stôl 2 už nie je v zozname
GET http://localhost:8080/api/waiter/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}